@host = http://localhost:5080

### List customers
GET {{host}}/customers

### Search customers
GET {{host}}/customers?search=globex

### Get one customer
GET {{host}}/customers/1

### A customer's invoices (optionally ?status=Paid)
GET {{host}}/customers/1/invoices

### Create a customer
POST {{host}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "email": "ada@analytical.example",
  "company": "Analytical Engines Ltd",
  "phone": "+44 20 7946 0000",
  "billingAddress": {
    "line1": "12 St James's Square",
    "city": "London",
    "postalCode": "SW1Y 4JH",
    "country": "GB"
  }
}

### List invoices (filters: customerId, status = Draft|Sent|Paid|Overdue|Void)
GET {{host}}/invoices?status=Overdue

### Get one invoice
GET {{host}}/invoices/1

### Create an invoice (starts as Draft; totals are calculated)
POST {{host}}/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "currency": "USD",
  "taxRate": 0.08,
  "notes": "Net 30",
  "lineItems": [
    { "description": "Consulting", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 150 },
    { "description": "Hosting (monthly)", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 49.99 }
  ]
}

### Lifecycle: Draft -> Sent -> Paid  (or Void while unpaid)
POST {{host}}/invoices/17/send

###
POST {{host}}/invoices/17/pay

###
POST {{host}}/invoices/14/void
